# vllm-arc fork-owned (no upstream .gitattributes exists).
#
# Banked evidence under results/ is byte-frozen: SHA256SUMS in every
# bank verify against the pulled working-tree bytes, and some banked
# rig logs carry mixed CRLF/LF terminators (docker log bytes as
# pulled). core.autocrlf=input would renormalize CRLF text on commit
# and break those checksums on fresh checkouts — `-text` disables all
# EOL conversion for the whole results tree (evidence immutability;
# the banking law's byte-exact redaction pass keeps relying on it).
results/** -text
